# What `npm run storybook` and `npm run dev` (index.html) talk to: a Location
# Service API endpoint and a bearer token for it, for example
# STORYBOOK_API_URL=https://api.example.com. Left empty, each says that no API
# is configured and sends nothing. Copy this file to `.env`, which git ignores;
# never commit real values here.
STORYBOOK_API_URL=
STORYBOOK_TOKEN=
VITE_API_URL=${STORYBOOK_API_URL}
VITE_TOKEN=${STORYBOOK_TOKEN}
